  "content": "\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\">\n  </a>\n  &nbsp;&nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\">\n  </a>\n</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n# 树木矿工\n\n一款 Minecraft 数据包，当你在蹲下状态时破坏原木，会自动砍倒整棵树。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wEhW4ceB/images/32390c308957b4fd88e0a12083649cd56b1ce576.gif\" alt=\"树木矿工预览\">\n</p>\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- 树木矿工仅在你蹲下（潜行）时才会激活\n- 若只想破坏单块原木，请保持站立状态正常破坏\n- 树叶会像手动破坏一样正常掉落物品（树苗、树枝等）\n- 连续使用之间设有短暂冷却时间，以避免引发性能问题",
